      "type": "monster",
      "name": "Reed Warden",
      "source": "Lantern Marsh, first edition",
      "data": {
        "description": "A Reed Warden is a Medium Humanoid, Neutral, that guards raised paths through the marsh. Armor Class 12; Hit Points 9; Speed 30 feet. Challenge 1/8 (25 XP); Proficiency Bonus +2. Strength 10, Dexterity 14, Constitution 10, Intelligence 10, Wisdom 12, Charisma 10. Staff: Melee Attack Roll +2, reach 5 feet, one target; Hit: 3 (1d6) Bludgeoning damage. Once per Long Rest, the warden can use an action to light a safe path for 2 minutes. It cannot use this signal while submerged. It carries one Signal Lantern.",
